      "params": [],
      "rightModuleId": 5386950514690086,
      "data": {
        "text": "The 12 Just Tones\n=================\n\nThis device outputs 12 voltages of stacked Pythagorean fifths, from Db around to F#. Be aware of where this puts your comma, and use CV (the module) to transpose around by fifths, if you want it someplace else. Run it into a COERCE for nice quantization.",
